# vcurp (tardis, 2026-11-26) = vcur + stairs_posture_drift W_PDRIFT -2 (1 s average of leg q - q0 beyond 0.05 rad, per 0.10 rad, squared): vcur 500 fell 64/64 from posture drift (pitch +11 -> -8 deg, pelvis -7 cm); gyaw 6000's gait pays only 0.4-0.6/s. Launch as vcur: ENT_COEF=0.0005, NUM_ENVS=1792, fixed lr 3e-4.
