# vcurpA (tardis) = vcurp11 resumed at 1500 + PDRIFT_ALL (upper band 0.35 rad): free arms let velocity learn from zero
# (vcurp/vcurp7/vcurp11 walked; vcurpa/b/L/w with upper-body constraints all stalled), so the arm fix comes after the gait.
# Stays forward-only (no 2000 switch: vcurp froze there) and the guard ramps continue from 36000/72000 (the runner restores
# the step counter), so the drift cost on every joint is the single deviation.
# vcurpA2 (tardis) = vcurpA resumed at 2500 + PDRIFT_FREE_UPPER 0.15 rad (was 0.35): at vcurpA 2500 most remaining arm offsets
# (shoulder P +17/+13, wrist R +-18, head P +19 deg) sat inside the 20 deg free band. Ramps continued from 60000 (vcurpA 2500).
# Abort to vcurpA 2500 if forward falls or lift < 2 cm.
RHPS1_STAIRS_OSEQ_FWD_STEPS=0
# vall (tardis) = vcurpA2 resumed at 3000 into every axis at once (OSEQ_FWD_STEPS 0), fixed lr 3e-4, ENT 0.0005: mirrors
# fw -> gi in position (a forward-only run resumed into the all-axes recipe learned the axes; gcur/gcurr froze on in-run
# curricula). Guard ramps were complete at vcurpA2 3000 (offsets 72000). Freeze signature: non-forward ratios ~0, 0 falls.
